<title>USA: Winsloew buys back 11 percent of shares.</title>
<headline>Winsloew buys back 11 percent of shares.</headline>
<dateline>PELHAM, Ala. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winsloew Furniture Inc said on Monday that it has repurchased 933,504 common shares, or 11 percent of its total common stock outstanding, in a privately negotiated transaction for $10.00 per share.</p>
<p>Funding was provided by an existing loan agreement, and the repurchased stock will be retired, the company said.</p>
<p>Following this repurchase, Winsloew will have 7,516,783 shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
<p>Winsloew said it will continue to buy its shares in the open market, or in privately negotiated transactions, at times and prices deemed advantageous.</p>
</text>
